/tmp/tmp.i55aPydxD9/main.tex:474:    A key contribution of Talagrand's conjecture is the established connection between so-called \emph{spread measure} and threshold in random graph theory. 
/tmp/tmp.i55aPydxD9/main.tex:475:    As a consequence, the task of establishing a robustness result reduces to proving the existence of a probability measure with good spread over the desired substructures. 
