/tmp/tmp.i55aPydxD9/main.tex:486:    Now we are ready to state our main technical result, which is a general structural theorem that serves as a robust version of the main result (Theorem~\ref{thm:han_structural_theorem}) from~\cite{han2020complexity}, strengthened via the spread-based framework described earlier. 
