%The remaining edges required to satisfy the lattice condition are completed using vertices in \(V_{\vec v}^+\), which still retain sufficient randomness around edges of type \(\vec v\) in \(H_p\).
%Correspondingly, the parameter \(c_{\vec v}\) describes how many edges of type \(\vec v\) are needed in total, while \(c_{\vec v}^*\) records how many of them are already realized inside the exposed set \(E(\vec v)\).  
