        %To that end, let $C_1=|U_1|$, $W_1:=[C_1]$, and for $i\ge2$, let $W_i:=[C_1+C(i-2)+1,C_1+C(i-1)]=[C_1+C(i-1)]\setminus\bigcup_{j=1}^{i-1}W_j$. 
