+2-by-2 matrices. Compose them, choose a parabolic projective transformation
+whose unique fixed point is the sampled start, and solve for the last matrix so
+the cyclic product is that transformation. The planted edge is then the forward
+trajectory of the already sampled start. This is inverse generation, not a
+search over the finished instance.
